; DIMALIGNED (PT26, #713): typed points, the Text option with a text without
; <>, and the Angle option; prompt [Mtext/Text/Angle] from autocad-quote.txt
; (dxf-test-file 1ad04b0), with Mtext since [0.8.1-PT3] (#930).
; Values by hand from PT23 with ISO-25: direction u = (0.6, 0.8), normal
; n = (-0.8, 0.6), the location 10 along n from the first origin; line-point
; is the foot of the second origin, as AutoCAD writes group 10
; (autocad-quote.dxf, handle BB); text-point is 1.875 along n from the middle
; for a text above the line, with six graphics records numbered after the
; dimension. With the explicit angle 90 of the third dimension the text is
; centred in the middle of the dimension line, which breaks around it (PT23,
; point 4; decision of the maintainer on #712): text-point 190,15 and seven
; graphics records.
DIMALIGNED
